{"seq":1,"slug":"release-automation-tools","title":"发布自动化工具链","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/release-engineering/automation-tooling/release-automation-tools","wordCount":1193,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"发布自动化工具链\">发布自动化工具链</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>发布自动化将版本号推断、变更日志生成、制品构建和发布动作串联为确定性管道。semantic-release（v25）实现全自动 commit 驱动发布，release-please 采用 PR 驱动模式保留人工审查点，Changesets 为 monorepo 提供声明式版本管理。工具选型取决于自动化程度需求、审查需求和仓库结构。</p>\n<h2 id=\"自动化的目标-消除发布过程中的人工决策点\">自动化的目标：消除发布过程中的人工决策点</h2><p>发布自动化不只是&quot;用脚本替代手动操作&quot;——它的深层目标是<strong>将发布决策从人工判断转化为可重复的规则执行</strong>。当版本号由 commit 历史推断、变更日志由工具生成、制品由管道自动构建并签名时，整个发布流程变成了一个确定性函数：相同输入（代码变更）产生相同输出（版本号+制品+发布说明）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"semantic-release-全自动化发布的参考实现\">semantic-release：全自动化发布的参考实现</h2><p>semantic-release（2026-06 最新 v25.0.5）是端到端发布自动化的事实标准。它通过插件管道将发布的每个步骤串联为一条自动化链：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[CI 触发] --&gt; B[verifyConditions]&#10;    B --&gt; C[analyzeCommits]&#10;    C --&gt; D[verifyRelease]&#10;    D --&gt; E[generateNotes]&#10;    E --&gt; F[prepare]&#10;    F --&gt; G[publish]&#10;    G --&gt; H[addChannel]&#10;    H --&gt; I[success/fail]\">flowchart LR\n    A[CI 触发] --&gt; B[verifyConditions]\n    B --&gt; C[analyzeCommits]\n    C --&gt; D[verifyRelease]\n    D --&gt; E[generateNotes]\n    E --&gt; F[prepare]\n    F --&gt; G[publish]\n    G --&gt; H[addChannel]\n    H --&gt; I[success/fail]</pre><p>各插件的职责：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>生命周期钩子</th>\n<th>默认插件</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>analyzeCommits</td>\n<td>@semantic-release/commit-analyzer</td>\n<td>解析 Conventional Commits，决定 bump 级别</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>generateNotes</td>\n<td>@semantic-release/release-notes-generator</td>\n<td>生成发布说明</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>prepare</td>\n<td>@semantic-release/changelog</td>\n<td>更新 CHANGELOG.md</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>publish</td>\n<td>@semantic-release/npm</td>\n<td>发布到 npm registry</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>publish</td>\n<td>@semantic-release/github</td>\n<td>创建 GitHub Release</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>success</td>\n<td>@semantic-release/git</td>\n<td>提交版本文件变更</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"多通道发布配置\">多通道发布配置</h3><p>semantic-release v25 支持多分支多通道的复杂发布策略：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;branches&quot;: [&#10;    &quot;+([0-9])?(.{+([0-9]),x}).x&quot;,&#10;    &quot;main&quot;,&#10;    &quot;next&quot;,&#10;    { &quot;name&quot;: &quot;beta&quot;, &quot;prerelease&quot;: true },&#10;    { &quot;name&quot;: &quot;alpha&quot;, &quot;prerelease&quot;: true }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"branches\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"+([0-9])?(.{+([0-9]),x}).x\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"main\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"next\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"beta\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"prerelease\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"alpha\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"prerelease\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个配置实现：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>main</code> 分支发布到 <code>@latest</code> dist-tag</li>\n<li><code>next</code> 分支发布到 <code>@next</code> dist-tag</li>\n<li><code>beta</code>/<code>alpha</code> 分支发布预发布版本</li>\n<li><code>1.x</code>、<code>2.x</code> 分支为旧 MAJOR 版本发布维护补丁</li>\n</ul>\n<p>关于版本语义和分支映射的详细策略，参见<a href=\"../versioning-strategy/semver-calver-practices\">语义化版本与日历版本</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"release-please-pr-驱动的发布流程\">release-please：PR 驱动的发布流程</h2><p>Google 的 release-please 采用不同哲学：不直接在 CI 中发布，而是维护一个 &quot;Release PR&quot;——累积变更、生成变更日志草稿，合并 PR 时才触发发布。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>semantic-release</th>\n<th>release-please</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>触发方式</td>\n<td>push 到 release 分支自动发布</td>\n<td>合并 Release PR 时发布</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>人工介入</td>\n<td>无（全自动）</td>\n<td>审查并合并 PR</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Monorepo 支持</td>\n<td>需要额外配置</td>\n<td>原生支持 manifest 模式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>变更日志预览</td>\n<td>发布后才可见</td>\n<td>PR 中预览</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用团队</td>\n<td>高度信任自动化的团队</td>\n<td>需要发布前审查的团队</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>release-please 的 manifest 模式允许在 monorepo 中为每个包独立管理版本：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;packages&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;packages/core&quot;: { &quot;release-type&quot;: &quot;node&quot; },&#10;    &quot;packages/cli&quot;: { &quot;release-type&quot;: &quot;node&quot; },&#10;    &quot;packages/server&quot;: { &quot;release-type&quot;: &quot;go&quot; }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"packages\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"packages/core\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"release-type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"node\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"packages/cli\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"release-type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"node\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"packages/server\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"release-type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"go\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"changesets-monorepo-的声明式版本管理\">Changesets：monorepo 的声明式版本管理</h2><p>Changesets 要求开发者在 PR 中显式声明变更的影响：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"markdown\" data-code=\"---&#10;&#39;@myorg/core&#39;: minor&#10;&#39;@myorg/cli&#39;: patch&#10;---&#10;&#10;新增 OAuth2 PKCE 支持，CLI 同步更新帮助文档\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'@myorg/core'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">minor</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'@myorg/cli'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">patch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">新增 OAuth2 PKCE 支持，CLI 同步更新帮助文档</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这些声明文件在发布时被消费：工具根据所有累积的 changeset 文件计算每个包的最终版本 bump，生成变更日志，然后删除已消费的 changeset 文件。</p>\n<p>优势：版本决策分散到每个 PR 中（由变更作者判断影响级别），而非集中在发布时由机器从 commit message 推断。</p>\n<h2 id=\"工具选型决策框架\">工具选型决策框架</h2><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>工具匹配度</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>自动化程度</mtext><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>审查需求</mtext><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>monorepo支持</mtext><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>语言生态</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{工具匹配度} = w_1 \\cdot \\text{自动化程度} + w_2 \\cdot \\text{审查需求} + w_3 \\cdot \\text{monorepo支持} + w_4 \\cdot \\text{语言生态}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">工具匹配度</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">自动化程度</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">审查需求</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">monorepo</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">支持</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">语言生态</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>推荐工具</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单包库，全自动</td>\n<td>semantic-release</td>\n<td>零人工介入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单包库，需审查</td>\n<td>release-please</td>\n<td>PR 驱动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>JS monorepo</td>\n<td>Changesets</td>\n<td>原生多包支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Go monorepo</td>\n<td>release-please manifest</td>\n<td>Go 版本标签特殊处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Python 项目</td>\n<td>python-semantic-release v10</td>\n<td>适配 PyPI 生态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rust 项目</td>\n<td>cargo-release + release-plz</td>\n<td>Cargo.toml 集成</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"ci-集成模式\">CI 集成模式</h2><h3 id=\"github-actions-示例-semantic-release\">GitHub Actions 示例（semantic-release）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"name: Release&#10;on:&#10;  push:&#10;    branches: [main, next, &#39;*.x&#39;]&#10;jobs:&#10;  release:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    permissions:&#10;      contents: write&#10;      packages: write&#10;      id-token: write # OIDC for npm provenance&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;        with: { fetch-depth: 0 }&#10;      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4&#10;        with: { node-version: 22 }&#10;      - run: npm ci&#10;      - run: npx semantic-release&#10;        env:&#10;          GITHUB_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN }}&#10;          NPM_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.NPM_TOKEN }}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Release</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    branches</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">next</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'*.x'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  release</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    permissions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      contents</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">write</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      packages</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">write</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      id-token</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">write</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # OIDC for npm provenance</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">fetch-depth</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/setup-node@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">node-version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">22</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">npm ci</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">npx semantic-release</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        env</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          GITHUB_TOKEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          NPM_TOKEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ secrets.NPM_TOKEN }}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>id-token: write</code> 权限启用 npm provenance——发布时自动生成 SLSA 来源证明，与<a href=\"signing-provenance\">签名与来源证明</a>中讨论的供应链安全实践直接关联。</p>\n<h2 id=\"发布自动化的成熟度模型\">发布自动化的成熟度模型</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>级别</th>\n<th>自动化范围</th>\n<th>人工参与</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>L0</td>\n<td>手动发布</td>\n<td>全手动</td>\n<td>人为错误、不可重复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L1</td>\n<td>脚本化构建</td>\n<td>人工触发、人工决策</td>\n<td>步骤可能被跳过</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L2</td>\n<td>CI 驱动发布</td>\n<td>人工审批</td>\n<td>审批瓶颈</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L3</td>\n<td>全自动（commit 驱动）</td>\n<td>仅异常处理</td>\n<td>需要高质量测试套件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L4</td>\n<td>全自动+自愈</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>需要金丝雀+自动回滚</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>从 L2 到 L3 的跃迁是最关键的——它要求团队对自动化测试有足够信心，愿意将&quot;是否发布&quot;的决策权完全交给机器。<a href=\"../release-process/artifact-promotion-pipeline\">制品晋升管道</a>中的质量门体系正是建立这种信心的基础设施。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>发布自动化的深层目标是将发布决策从人工判断转化为规则执行</li>\n<li>semantic-release v25 实现全自动发布——commit 驱动，零人工介入</li>\n<li>release-please 通过 Release PR 保留发布前审查机会</li>\n<li>Changesets 将版本决策分散到每个 PR 中，适合 monorepo</li>\n<li>CI 中 <code>id-token: write</code> 权限启用 npm provenance 来源证明</li>\n<li>从 L2（人工审批）到 L3（全自动）的跃迁需要对测试套件的充分信心</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"发布自动化工具链","id":"发布自动化工具链"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"自动化的目标：消除发布过程中的人工决策点","id":"自动化的目标-消除发布过程中的人工决策点"},{"level":2,"text":"semantic-release：全自动化发布的参考实现","id":"semantic-release-全自动化发布的参考实现"},{"level":3,"text":"多通道发布配置","id":"多通道发布配置"},{"level":2,"text":"release-please：PR 驱动的发布流程","id":"release-please-pr-驱动的发布流程"},{"level":2,"text":"Changesets：monorepo 的声明式版本管理","id":"changesets-monorepo-的声明式版本管理"},{"level":2,"text":"工具选型决策框架","id":"工具选型决策框架"},{"level":2,"text":"CI 集成模式","id":"ci-集成模式"},{"level":3,"text":"GitHub Actions 示例（semantic-release）","id":"github-actions-示例-semantic-release"},{"level":2,"text":"发布自动化的成熟度模型","id":"发布自动化的成熟度模型"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"热修复与紧急发布","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/release-engineering/release-process/hotfix-emergency-release"},"next":{"title":"包注册中心与分发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/release-engineering/automation-tooling/package-registry-management"}}